    "1 pound cubed beef stew meat",
    "1 (10.75 ounce) can condensed golden mushroom soup",
    "0.5 cup chopped onion",
    "0.25 cup water",
    "1 tablespoon Worcestershire sauce",
    "4 ounces cream cheese"
